config BR2_PACKAGE_WAVESHARE_28DPI_OVERLAYS
	bool "waveshare-28dpi-overlays"
	help
	  Waveshare's device tree overlay for the 2.8inch DPI LCD's touch
	  controller.

	  Downloaded from Waveshare's own file server, the pack their wiki
	  page links: https://www.waveshare.com/wiki/2.8inch_DPI_LCD
	  Only the Goodix touch controller on its bit-banged i2c bus is
	  taken; build.sh puts it in the initramfs as the 2.8-inch's touch
	  overlay (docs/IMAGES.md §3.3).
